Bundled Bible texts

core/src/main/resources/bible/RST.SQLite3 (Russian Synodal translation, 1876)
and KJV.SQLite3 (King James Version, 1769 edition) are public domain texts.
Text source: scrollmapper/bible_databases (https://github.com/scrollmapper/bible_databases,
MIT License); converted to MyBible format by tools/bible/make_modules.py.


Bundled fonts

android/receiver/src/main/res/font: Carlito and Caladea (Google, metric-compatible
with Calibri and Cambria) and Liberation Sans (Red Hat, metric-compatible with Arial),
all under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. They are used by the built-in PPTX to PDF
conversion so that lines break where PowerPoint breaks them.
